$\|2 \mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}\|^2 = \left\|2\mathbf{a}+ \mathbf{b} \right\|^2 = (2 \mathbf{a}+ \mathbf{b}) \cdot (2 \mathbf{a}+ \mathbf{b})$

